{
  "description": "Phone-normalization contract, vendored byte-identically into the four Tracive SDK repositories. Expected values were produced by the Tracive app's PhoneUtils.normalizePhoneNumber — app and SDK must fold the same person to the same record key.",
  "version": 7,
  "countryCount": 245,
  "vectors": [
